### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/managers/users
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### Approve User
PATCH http://localhost:3000/managers/users/2/approve
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### Reject User
PATCH http://localhost:3000/managers/users/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### Set Role + Salary
PATCH http://localhost:3000/managers/users/2/role-salary
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "EMPLOYEE",
  "hourlyRate": 20
}

### Get all leave requests
GET http://localhost:3000/managers/leave-requests
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### Approve leave request
PATCH http://localhost:3000/managers/leave-requests/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### Reject leave request
PATCH http://localhost:3000/managers/leave-requests/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN

### Get all availabilities
GET http://localhost:3000/managers/availabilities
Authorization: Bearer MANAGER_TOKEN